#: scenario2:scenario2_EFAAD7BF_B55B_4DCA_B23A_E7781A844AE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac5076675e9c1be36f8a92abf9cbd2c737843744593a45ccc67793178cebab80
